WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Four runs explained the set.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.100
Section 5.5 asked for one more thing.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.600
A correction, not a fifth question.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.200
The button hands back a whole prompt.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.200
So the client parses nothing.

6
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.700
It only refuses what it is sure of.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.200
It is offered once the run is over.

8
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.200
Which made keeping them in step dead code.

9
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.900
The set is editable.
